OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal children's home use in    
OL,4,ANorthamptonshire rises                 
OL,6,FThe number of vulnerable young people  
OL,7,Fin illegal children's homes in         
OL,8,FNorthamptonshire has risen despite a   
OL,9,F#40m promise to improve local          
OL,10,Fprovision, it can be revealed.         
OL,12,FWest and North Northamptonshire        
OL,13,Fcouncils said 13 children were living  
OL,14,Fin homes not regulated by Ofsted,      
OL,15,Fmaking them technically illegal. The   
OL,16,Fnumber has risen from 11 in November   
OL,17,F2024.                                  
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
