OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal children's home use in    
OL,4,ANorthamptonshire rises                 
OL,6,FIn late 2024, the councils pledged #20m
OL,7,Feach to Northamptonshire Children's    
OL,8,FTrust (NCT). It was set up to run local
OL,9,Fchildren's services in 2021 when the   
OL,10,Fformer county council was disbanded.   
OL,12,FThe funding pledged was meant to reduce
OL,13,Freliance on unregulated homes by       
OL,14,Fcreating new regulated places. A trust 
OL,15,Fspokesperson admitted this had "not    
OL,16,Fprogressed at the pace originally      
OL,17,Fanticipated".                          
